格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"本地 OCR 插件：让纯文本生成 LLM 也能读懂图片 | Local OCR plugin: give text-only generative LLMs the ability to read images","id":"gh:1334433015","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-tool-ocr","slug":"ferstar/dsh-tool-ocr","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","ocr","plugin","vision"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"本地 OCR 插件：让纯文本生成 LLM 也能读懂图片 | Local OCR plugin: give text-only generative LLMs the ability to read i"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"R 插件：让纯文本生成 LLM 也能读懂图片 | Local OCR plugin: give text-only generative LLMs the ability to read images"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-tool-ocr"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Local image text recognition for DeepSeek Harness models **without vision input**, backed by the sta"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ndalone newbee-ocr (`nbocr`) engine over PP-OCRv6 models. Fully out-of-tree: depends only on publish"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ed dsh base packages."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Item | Description |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| `ocr` tool | `recognize` / `status` / `install` / `check` actions |\n| Image inputs | Local `path`,"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" or `attachment_id` (an image already in the conversation) |\n| Output | Reading-ordered text, per-bl"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ock bounding boxes, review flags (low confidence / amounts / numbers / dates / quantities), heuristi"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"c Markdown tables |\n| Robustness | Survives MNN diagnostics in engine stdout; honors cancellation an"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"d timeout |\n| Settings card | On dsh ≥ 0.1.0-rc.7 the plugin registers the `tool-ocr` namespace: the"},{"id":"p7s6","text":" web **Settings → Plugins** page renders a card that edits the engine command, model tier, and run b"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ounds live — no composition edit needed |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**1. Install the engine** — grab `nbocr` from the newbee-ocr-cli releases (one-line installer or pre"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"e engine** — grab `nbocr` from the newbee-ocr-cli releases (one-line installer or prebuilt archive):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**2. Install the plugin**"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**3. Mount it** in your profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"That's it — restart dsh, then point the model at an image: `ocr { path: \"C:/screenshot.png\" }`. To t"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"une recognition (language, model tier, limits), open **Settings → Plugins → Plugin config** and edit"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" the OCR card; changes apply on save, no restart needed. `command` is the only field that must come "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"from the composition."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Image inputs"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **`path`** works on every dsh build: the model reads the file from disk.\n- **`attachment_id`** nee"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ds a build that admits images for text-only models (e.g. the dsh fork with `api-gateway.allowImagePl"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"aceholder: true`): images enter the session, the llm layer substitutes `[image attachment <id>]` tex"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"t, and the model hands the id to `ocr`."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Field | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| `command` | — (required) | The nbocr executable: absolute path or PATH-resolved name. |\n| `args` |"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" `[]` | Extra arguments before the nbocr subcommand (no shell). |\n| `env` | `{}` | Extra environment"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" entries. |\n| `language` | `chinese` | Recognition model/language alias. |\n| `detModel` | `v6-tiny` "},{"id":"p20s4","text":"| Detection model tier. |\n| `modelsDir` | `''` | Model directory for non-embedded models; empty uses"},{"id":"p20s5","text":" embedded models. |\n| `maxImageBytes` | `26214400` | Largest accepted image in bytes. |\n| `maxOutput"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"Bytes` | `2000000` | Largest collected engine stdout in bytes. |\n| `maxTextChars` | `12000` | Larges"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"t recognized text returned in `text`. |\n| `timeoutMs` | `600000` | Tool-call timeout budget in ms. |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Tool usage"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"`status` probes readiness without engine work; `check` runs a real end-to-end 1x1 probe."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Real-engine smoke (skipped unless both env vars are set):"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
